# r1115 phase 5 (runner-5), boot A1 follow-ups 2 (same server): Rare Ice's own block and the netherite area till per cell.
pace 1

## SQ-MELT-09b-rareice2 | rare-ice:rare_ice roofed beside a sea lantern: kept at vanillaLightMelting false (redirect applies); melts after the srv toml says true (config refresh)
> forceload add 2400 2400 2431 2431
> fill 2420 -61 2410 2424 -58 2414 minecraft:stone
> setblock 2422 -60 2412 rare-ice:rare_ice
> setblock 2423 -60 2412 minecraft:sea_lantern
> zmelt w rareice overworld 2422 -60 2412
> data get block 2422 -60 2412
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 1000
sleep 60
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute if block 2422 -60 2412 rare-ice:rare_ice run say MELT09b-rareice-kept-off
shell python3 $INST/tools/scratch_query/qrun.py toml config/creativecommon-common.toml melting vanillaLightMelting true; sed -n "/^\[melting\]/,/^\[/p" config/creativecommon-common.toml | grep -E "^\s*vanillaLightMelting ="
sleep 8
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 1000
sleep 60
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute unless block 2422 -60 2412 rare-ice:rare_ice run say MELT09b-rareice-melted-on
> zmelt show
> zmelt clear
shell python3 $INST/tools/scratch_query/qrun.py toml config/creativecommon-common.toml melting vanillaLightMelting false; sed -n "/^\[melting\]/,/^\[/p" config/creativecommon-common.toml | grep -E "^\s*vanillaLightMelting ="
sleep 8
expect MELT09b-rareice-kept-off$
expect MELT09b-rareice-melted-on$
look kept 60 s at false; melted (watch tick) after the edit to true; toml back to false at the end

